  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfShareholderTreasurySharesEtc contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">オーウエル株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfShareholderTreasurySharesEtc>
  <jpcrp_cor:AddressOfShareholderTreasurySharesEtc contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">大阪府大阪市西淀川区御幣島五丁目13番９号</jpcrp_cor:AddressOfShareholderTreasurySharesEtc>
  <jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:1pt;font-size:1pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class="smt_head2" style="padding-left:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;【株式の種類等】　普通株式&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(1) 【株主総会決議による取得の状況】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;　     該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(2) 【取締役会決議による取得の状況】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;　     該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(3) 【株主総会決議又は取締役会決議に基づかないものの内容】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;　     該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:DisposalsOrHoldingOfAcquiredTreasurySharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
